WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.934
Heritage of Flavours, the World Culinary Council.

2
00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:12.106
Here, every cuisine is judged by its own tradition, not by the standards of another.

3
00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:18.633
Three principles. Every cuisine by its own laws.

4
00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:22.310
A living tradition, as it is cooked today.

5
00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:26.950
And the title of judge cannot be appointed or bought:

6
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:28.526
it must be earned.

7
00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:36.522
The evaluation has two parts: mastery and tradition.

8
00:00:36.522 --> 00:00:46.248
And the voice of the Keeper of Traditions, the judge who knows this cuisine from within, counts for half of the tradition score.

9
00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:54.086
All the laws of the cuisines are gathered in one shared book:

10
00:00:54.086 --> 00:01:03.271
the Codex "Meridian of Flavours". Each chapter is written by its author, a founder of Heritage of Flavours.

11
00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:13.469
The system has three branches: those who create knowledge, those who judge, and those who bring people together.

12
00:01:13.469 --> 00:01:18.713
And an independent Mediator makes sure everyone is treated fairly.

13
00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:26.502
The judge's path begins at the Academy. Theory online, in your own language.

14
00:01:26.502 --> 00:01:34.617
Then practice at a festival, the exam, and a certificate you can verify in the public registry.

15
00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:41.454
Every cuisine has its story. Every story deserves to be heard.

16
00:01:41.454 --> 00:01:43.329
Heritage of Flavours.
